			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="13" y="5" width="100" height="20" uuid="90da8853-4a53-44af-9f53-18e4b111d415"/>
				<textElement verticalAlignment="Middle">
					<font fontName="Arial" size="12"  pdfFontName="Helvetica-Bold"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Note to Shipper: ]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="13" y="33" width="530" height="181" uuid="26f46a09-2b07-4047-80f6-4acb5f90b7c4"/>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[1. The shipping Order is not transferable and is issued subject to availability of space on the vessel for loading
    the cargo and to the terms and conditions of the relevant Bill of Lading
2. The Carriers or the Agents will not assume any reponsibility or liability of whatsoever nature if the cargo covered
    by this Shipping Order is shut out.
3. Cargo/Packages stuffed in any container should not exceed safe carrying capacity of the container and stuffed
    container has to be delivered to the Container Terminal 8 hours before ship's arrival, with all export
    formalities/Documentation duly completed.
4. If cargo is of hazardous nature, please ensure that appropriate IMDG labels are affixed on the container before
    delivering to port.  Any penalities/fines for not affixing proper IMCO lables will be to the account of shipper.
5. Cancellation of Booking should be intimated to this office in writing at least 8 hours prior to the vessel arrival.
    If the containers are cancelled and/or rebooked on another vessel/vessels cancellation/rebooked charges as
    applicable will be to the shipper's account
6. Container must be collected from the port within five working days from the date of Mate Receipt,
    otherwise empty storage charges are to be paid by Shipper.
7.  If export containers are not returned to port within FREE Days line demurage charges applies as per tariff.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="13" y="214" width="530" height="40" uuid="d9fc2e39-605f-463e-a8b5-08c4f41fc07f"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified">
					<font fontName="Arial" size="10"  pdfFontName="Helvetica-Bold"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[8. Before returning the laden container to terminal all IMCO labels must be removed, failing which all
   charges associated with this will be debited to shipper.]]></text>
			</staticText>
		</band>
